      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Subject: Update on Mr. Henderson\n\nDear Mr. Henderson's Family,\n\nI wanted to reach out and provide you with an update regarding his current condition. Mr. Henderson is in the final stages of lung cancer, and he is experiencing increased respiratory distress developed over the past 24 hours, with his oxygen needs now at 5L. His blood pressure remains unstable and his heart rate varies. At this time, he is in a state of lethargy and minimally responsive to verbal prompts, although we want to remind you that these moments are precious and filled with the love and presence shared with him by those around him.\n\nUnderstanding the focus on his comfort, we have made a compassionate decision to transition him to comfort care only, in alignment with the DNR/DNI that you've had the necessary conversations about with Mr. Henderson. Our goal is to ensure peace and a serene environment for him in his final days. Should you need any further information or support during this difficult time, please don't hesitate to reach out to us. We are here to provide care and assistance in any way possible.\n\nWith deep compassion and understanding,\n\n[Doctor's Name] [Contact Information]",
