      "role": "user",
      "content": "Thanks for this. It's a good start, but I'm looking at the sentiment score for this draft and it's coming back a bit low (around 0.45). \n\nI know I said not to game it, but I really need this to feel a bit more uplifting and peaceful for the family. It currently feels a little heavy on the clinical decline. Could you try another version? Try to infuse more warmth and gentle language to bring that positivity score up a bit, but please, please keep the clinical facts accurate. I don't want it to be fake, just... less bleak.",
